msgid ""
"<b>Total numbers for the %1$s.</b><br/><br/>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Lifetime sales</b> are the total amount of money earned from the %2$s, considering all the %3$s for the %4$s in the current currency.<br/>\n"
